    "markdown": "# Recap MCQs\n<center>\n![](/images/question_bubble_blue.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white solid 5px\"}\n</center>\n\nSuperb! That is the end of the chapter. Please ensure you are saving your scripts regularly.\n\nFor a recap please attempt the below MCQs.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n1. Which __variable__ naming convention uses underscores to separate words? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_XDQZPNLYOP'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_XDQZPNLYOP\" value=\"\"></input> <span>Camel case</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_XDQZPNLYOP\" value=\"\"></input> <span>Period separated</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_XDQZPNLYOP\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>Snake case</span></label></div>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n2. Which __variable__ naming convention uses upper case to denote new words? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_OCBHQICYSA'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_OCBHQICYSA\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>Camel case</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_OCBHQICYSA\" value=\"\"></input> <span>Period separated</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_OCBHQICYSA\" value=\"\"></input> <span>Snake case</span></label></div>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n3. Which button can you use to clear the text from your console or environment? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_HTZAVZUCRT'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_HTZAVZUCRT\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`seq()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_HTZAVZUCRT\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>Sweep</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_HTZAVZUCRT\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`rep()`</span></label></div>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n4. Which __function__ allows you replicate an __object__? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_BSJVKJHEOG'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_BSJVKJHEOG\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`seq()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_BSJVKJHEOG\" value=\"\"></input> <span>Sweep</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_BSJVKJHEOG\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>`rep()`</span></label></div>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n5. Which __function__ can be used to create a numeric sequence? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_WVYKAVCZBP'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_WVYKAVCZBP\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>`seq()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_WVYKAVCZBP\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>Sweep</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_WVYKAVCZBP\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`rep()`</span></label></div>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n6. Which __function__ is useful for changing NAs to 0s? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_BSVGBPGIPN'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_BSVGBPGIPN\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`gsub()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_BSVGBPGIPN\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>`is.na()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_BSVGBPGIPN\" value=\"\"></input> <span>Tab</span></label></div>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n7. Which key can be used to auto-complete file and __function__ names?  <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_AWJGBBAODQ'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_AWJGBBAODQ\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`gsub()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_AWJGBBAODQ\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`is.na()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_AWJGBBAODQ\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>Tab</span></label></div>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n8. Which __function__ can be used to replace patterns? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_SNAWUDJZKN'><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_SNAWUDJZKN\" value=\"answer\"></input> <span>`gsub()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_SNAWUDJZKN\" value=\"\"></input> <span>`is.na()`</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"radio_SNAWUDJZKN\" value=\"\"></input> <span>Tab</span></label></div>\n\n\nNow time for exercises!",
